# E00 Agents5: parallel, the two agents interleave differently at each run; compared: the lines of each agent in order,
# the counts, and the turn barriers (setups in turn 0, actions in turn 1, then each agent finds its mailbox empty and
# stops in turn 2, which ends the simulation).
cover all
fact line ^(Setup|Act): (\d+) from (a1\*|a2)$
fact stop ^(a\d): No messages$
fact phase ^(?:(Setup|Act)|a\d: (No) messages)
same line seq by 2
same stop bag
same phase seq
check line count == 26
check stop count == 2
fact error (Exception|out of range)
optional error
check error count == 0
